{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19047","headline":"微之镇武昌中路见寄蓝桥怀旧之作凄然继和兼寄安平 · 刘禹锡","name":"微之镇武昌中路见寄蓝桥怀旧之作凄然继和兼寄安平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日油幢引，他年黄纸追。\n同爲三楚客，独有九霄期。\n宿草恨长在，伤禽飞尚迟。\n武昌应已到，新柳映红旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}